        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An information content entity that holds the weight-of-evidence assessment of a key event relationship: its overall rating and the descriptions of biological plausibility, empirical support and uncertainties or inconsistencies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
